#: processes/content/hcert-issuance.bpmn:40
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Attach the returned signature to make the COSE_Sign1, checking it is the length the algorithm gives (64 bytes for ES256, r||s)."
msgstr "Adjuntar la firma devuelta para hacer el COSE_Sign1, comprobando que es la longitud que el algoritmo da (64 bytes para ES256, rs)."

#: processes/content/hcert-issuance.bpmn:40
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Attach the signature as COSE_Sign1"
msgstr "Adjuntar la firma como COSE_Sign1"

#: processes/content/hcert-issuance.bpmn:38
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build the COSE Sig_structure from the protected header (alg, kid = SHA-256 of the DSC, first 8 bytes) and the payload, and hand its bytes out to be signed."
msgstr "Construye la estructura COSE Sig_ desde el encabezado protegido (alg, kid = SHA-256 del DSC, primeros 8 bytes) y la carga útil, y entrega sus bytes para ser firmados."

#: processes/content/hcert-issuance.bpmn:36
